  ${BOLD}model${OFF} NAME  Fetch another local model
  ${BOLD}providers${OFF} status|set|verify|discard|activate|recover|record-revoked|spending|install-ui-control
  ${BOLD}providers chatgpt${OFF} status|login|models|cancel ID|logout ID
